    {
      "source": "Mixins added by default are <code>QueryByExampleExecutor</code> and <code>ReactiveQueryByExampleExecutor</code> respectively. Those interfaces are\nexplained in detail in <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../query-by-example.html#query-by-example\">Query by Example</a>.",
      "translation": "默认添加的混入分别是<code>QueryByExampleExecutor</code>和<code>ReactiveQueryByExampleExecutor</code>。这些接口在<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../query-by-example.html#query-by-example\">按示例查询</a>中进行了详细说明。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Both the <code>QuerydslPredicateExecutor</code> and <code>CypherdslConditionExecutor</code> provide the same concept: SDN generates a query, you\nprovide \"predicates\" (Query DSL) or \"conditions\" (Cypher DSL) that will be added. We recommend the Cypher DSL, as this is\nwhat SDN uses natively. You might even want to consider using the\n<a href=\"https://neo4j.github.io/cypher-dsl#thespringdataneo4j6annotationprocessor\">annotation processor</a> that generates\na static meta model for you.",
      "translation": "`QuerydslPredicateExecutor` 和 `CypherdslConditionExecutor` 提供了相同的核心概念：SDN 生成查询，而您提供将附加的“谓词”（Query DSL）或“条件”（Cypher DSL）。我们推荐使用 Cypher DSL，因为这是 SDN 原生支持的方式。您可能甚至希望考虑使用\n<a href=\"https://neo4j.github.io/cypher-dsl#thespringdataneo4j6annotationprocessor\">注解处理器</a>，该处理器会为您生成静态元模型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>CypherdslStatementExecutor</code> comes with several overloads for <code>findOne</code> and <code>findAll</code>. They all take a Cypher-DSL\nstatement respectively an ongoing definition of that as a first parameter and in case of the projecting methods, a type.",
      "translation": "`CypherdslStatementExecutor` 提供了多个 `findOne` 和 `findAll` 的重载方法。它们分别接受一个 Cypher DSL 语句及其作为第一个参数的持续定义；对于投影方法，还需额外指定一个类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Please use the <code>ReactiveCypherdslStatementExecutor</code> when extending the <code>ReactiveNeo4jRepository</code>.",
      "translation": "在扩展<code>ReactiveNeo4jRepository</code>时，请使用<code>ReactiveCypherdslStatementExecutor</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Neo4j offers a couple of extensions or \"mixins\" that can be added to repositories. What is a mixin? According to\n<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mixin\">Wikipedia</a> mixins are a language concept that allows a programmer to inject some code\ninto a class. Mixin programming is a style of software development, in which units of functionality are created in a class\nand then mixed in with other classes.",
      "translation": "Spring Data Neo4j 提供了几种可以添加到仓库中的扩展或“混入”（mixin）。什么是混入？根据<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mixin\">维基百科</a>的定义，混入是一种语言概念，允许程序员将某些代码注入到类中。混入编程是一种软件开发风格，在这种风格中，功能单元在类中创建，然后与其他类混合使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "How does that work? Declare your repository as described above and add <strong>one</strong>  of the following interfaces:",
      "translation": "它是如何运作的？按照上述方式声明您的仓库，并添加以下接口之一：<strong>一个</strong>：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Adding the corresponding mixin is not different from using the <a href=\"#sdn-mixins.dynamic-conditions\">condition excecutor</a>:",
      "translation": "添加相应的混入与使用<a href=\"#sdn-mixins.dynamic-conditions\">条件执行器</a>并无不同：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>findAll</code> methods works similar.\nThe imperative Cypher-DSL statement executor also provides an overload returning paged results.",
      "translation": "`findAll` 方法的工作原理类似。命令式 Cypher DSL 语句执行器也提供了一个返回分页结果的重载方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Java does not support that concept on the language level, but we do emulate it via a couple of interfaces and a runtime\nthat adds appropriate implementations and interceptors for.",
      "translation": "Java 在语言层面并不支持该概念，但我们通过几个接口以及一个运行时来模拟它，该运行时添加了相应的实现和拦截器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Additional mixins provided are:",
      "translation": "提供的附加混入包括：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Exemplary usage is shown with the Cypher DSL condition executor:",
      "translation": "示例用法展示如下，使用 Cypher DSL 条件执行器：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The code looks pretty similar for the Query-DSL mixin. Reasons for the Query-DSL mixin can be familiarity of the API and\nthat it works with other stores, too. Reasons against it are the fact that you need an additional library on the class path,\nit’s missing support for traversing relationships and the above-mentioned fact that it doesn’t support parameters in its\npredicates (it technically does, but there are no API methods to actually pass them to the query being executed).",
      "translation": "Query-DSL 混合类的代码看起来相当相似。支持 Query-DSL 混合类的原因在于其 API 的熟悉度，以及它能够与其他存储系统协同工作。反对使用它的原因包括：需要在类路径中添加额外的库；缺乏对关系遍历的支持；以及上述提到的问题——即其谓词不支持参数（尽管技术上支持，但缺少实际将参数传递给执行查询的 API 方法）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If a query requires parameters, they must be defined via the Cypher-DSL itself and also populated by it, as the following listing shows:",
      "translation": "如果查询需要参数，则必须通过 Cypher-DSL 本身定义并由其填充，如下所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
