      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>The dynamic query is build in a type safe way in a helper method</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>We already saw this in <a href=\"#sdn-mixins.dynamic-conditions\">here</a>, where we also defined some variables holding the model</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>We define an anonymous parameter, filled by the actual value of <code>name</code>, which was passed to the method</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td>The statement returned from the helper method is used to find an entity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"5\"></i><b>5</b></td>\n<td>Or a projection.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>动态查询通过辅助方法以类型安全的方式构建。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>我们在<a href=\"#sdn-mixins.dynamic-conditions\">此处</a>已经见过类似用法，当时也定义了一些持有模型的变量。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>我们定义了一个匿名参数，其值由传递给方法的<code>name</code>的实际值填充。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td>辅助方法返回的语句用于查找实体。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"5\"></i><b>5</b></td>\n<td>或者是一个投影。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
